 "R3_slicing_clause": "A different GN slicing of the SAME bulk cannot regularise the pinch: Kretschmann is a scalar invariant and the P43-1 track has it diverging at the throat as y->y* (713 at y=0 -> 1.09e7 at y=0.45, grid-converged in P29-3). R3 was therefore attempted as a different bulk ANSATZ (floored D), audited above.",
