  "price": "one additional pre-existing Z2 mirror brane at y_c=0.30 r0, tension-like: sigma in [1.001, 1.472] over |z|<=3 (peak at throat), p_z,p_th ~ -1; NEC/WEC/DEC pass (NEC saturated, min +0.0007, within the k-method's ~0.8% validation error of saturation); SEC fails at -1.998, exactly the positive-tension value (sigma+p_z+2p_th ~ -2 lambda) -- the same SEC status as the RS brane tension itself. NO bulk matter, NO added endpoint-brane matter."
